OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786702689
OL,3,CTrain derails near Lewes station with
OL,4,Creports dozens of passengers trapped
OL,6,FA passenger train has derailed near
OL,7,FLewes Station in East Sussex with
OL,8,Freports dozens of people are trapped.
OL,10,FITV Meridian understands that the
OL,11,Fderailment was caused by a track
OL,12,Fdefect as the Southern service was
OL,13,Ftravelling southbound just north of
OL,14,FLewes station tunnel.
OL,16,FThe train driver contacted control at
OL,17,F3:51pm, advising of the cause of the
OL,18,Fissue.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/10
