PN,38202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786702689
OL,3,CTrain derails near Lewes station with
OL,4,Creports dozens of passengers trapped
OL,6,FThree rear carriages of the train are
OL,7,Fcurrently on their side, but it is
OL,8,Funderstood there are no fatalities.
OL,10,FAt least one of the three carriages
OL,11,Fappears to have slid down an
OL,12,Fembankment.
OL,14,FPeople can be seen standing on the top
OL,15,Fof carriages as others are treated by
OL,16,Fparamedics at the scene, with coach
OL,17,Fnumber 7 "completely unaccessible."
OL,19,FThree air ambulances have arrived at
OL,20,Fthe scene with around 20 other
OL,21,Femergency vehicles.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
