OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786702689
OL,3,CTrain derails near Lewes station with
OL,4,Creports dozens of passengers trapped
OL,6,FLadders can be seen against the side
OL,7,Fof the carriages.
OL,9,FAn East Sussex Fire and Rescue
OL,10,Fspokesperson said: "We can confirm we
OL,11,Fwere called at 3.55pm to reports that
OL,12,Fa train had derailed just outside
OL,13,FLewes.
OL,15,F"We continue to work at the scene
OL,16,Falongside our emergency service
OL,17,Fcolleagues and other partners.
OL,19,F"Please avoid the area."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
