PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786702689
OL,3,CTrain derails near Lewes station with
OL,4,Creports dozens of passengers trapped
OL,6,FA spokesperson for British Transport
OL,7,FPolice said: "Officers are currently
OL,8,Fon scene close to Lewes railway
OL,9,Fstation following reports of a
OL,10,Fderailed train at 3.54pm today (13
OL,11,FAugust).
OL,13,F"We're responding alongside paramedics
OL,14,Fand the fire service and will provide
OL,15,Fmore information as soon as we can."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/10
