PN,38205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786702689
OL,3,CTrain derails near Lewes station with
OL,4,Creports dozens of passengers trapped
OL,6,FIn a statement, South East Coast
OL,7,FAmbulance Service NHS Foundation Trust
OL,8,Fsaid: "South East Coast Ambulance
OL,9,FService is currently responding to
OL,10,Freports of an incident near Lewes
OL,11,FRailway Station in Sussex.
OL,13,F"We were called shortly before 4pm
OL,14,Ftoday (13 August) and have a number of
OL,15,Fambulance resources at the scene,
OL,16,Fincluding specialist teams, working
OL,17,Falongside our emergency service
OL,18,Fpartners.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786702689
OL,3,CTrain derails near Lewes station with
OL,4,Creports dozens of passengers trapped
OL,6,F"We have no further information to
OL,7,Fshare at this time but will provide
OL,8,Fupdates as soon as possible."
OL,10,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,11,Fsaid she is "deeply concerned" by the
OL,12,Fderailment in Sussex, which involves a
OL,13,FSouthern Railway train.
OL,15,FWriting on X, the Cabinet minister
OL,16,Fsaid: "Deeply concerned of reports of
OL,17,Fa derailment involving a Southern
OL,18,Ftrain in Lewes, Sussex.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786702689
OL,3,CTrain derails near Lewes station with
OL,4,Creports dozens of passengers trapped
OL,6,F"Grateful to emergency services who
OL,7,Fare on the scene supporting those
OL,8,Fimpacted.
OL,10,F"We are working quickly with the rail
OL,11,Findustry and local partners to assist
OL,12,Fpassengers."
OL,14,FHelena Dollimore, the Labour MP for
OL,15,FHastings and Rye in East Sussex, said
OL,16,Fnews of a derailment in the area was
OL,17,F"deeply distressing".
OL,19,FShe said: "It is deeply distressing to
OL,20,Fhear that a train on our local line
OL,21,Fhas derailed near Lewes.
OL,26,@yD@AOUyD@TO]{D@KOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/10
