OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786702689
OL,3,CTrain derails near Lewes station with
OL,4,Creports dozens of passengers trapped
OL,6,F"I am in touch with the relevant
OL,7,Fauthorities now and will provide
OL,8,Ffurther updates as soon as I have more
OL,9,Finformation.
OL,11,F"This is clearly a very serious and
OL,12,Fdeveloping incident, and my thoughts
OL,13,Fare with everyone affected.
OL,15,F"In the meantime, if you are concerned
OL,16,Fabout someone or need urgent
OL,17,Fassistance, please contact the
OL,18,Femergency services.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/10
