OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786702689
OL,3,CTrain derails near Lewes station with
OL,4,Creports dozens of passengers trapped
OL,6,FMs Dollimore urged her constituents to
OL,7,Fcontact her office if they need
OL,8,F"urgent support".
OL,10,FA spokesperson for Lewes District
OL,11,FCouncil said: "We are aware of the
OL,12,Ftrain derailment near Lewes station.
OL,14,F"We are supporting East Sussex Fire &
OL,15,FRescue Service and other emergency
OL,16,Fservices. Please avoid the area at
OL,17,Fthis time."
OL,19,FMore to follow.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@PO]
